Input: {"question": "What is the occupation of Michel Gardes?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 75, "text": "Title: The Unassuming Life of Michel Gardes: A Tale of Politics and Pension"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 77, "end": 193, "text": "In the quaint town of Lyon, France, a man named Michel Gardes lived a life that was both ordinary and extraordinary."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 194, "end": 321, "text": "To the casual observer, Michel was just another pensioner, collecting his monthly stipend and enjoying the fruits of his labor."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 322, "end": 428, "text": "However, beneath the surface lay a complex web of experiences, shaped by his years as a French politician."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 429, "end": 510, "text": "Michel's journey began in the 1970s, when he first entered the world of politics."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 511, "end": 607, "text": "With a passion for public service, he dedicated himself to making a difference in his community."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 608, "end": 702, "text": "He started at the local level, working tirelessly to address the concerns of his constituents."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 703, "end": 838, "text": "His dedication and charisma soon earned him recognition, and he rose through the ranks, becoming a respected figure in French politics."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 839, "end": 950, "text": "As Michel navigated the intricacies of political life, he developed a deep understanding of the pension system."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 951, "end": 1061, "text": "He recognized the importance of providing for the elderly, ensuring they could live with dignity and security."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1062, "end": 1204, "text": "During his tenure, he championed several initiatives aimed at strengthening the pension framework, fighting to protect the rights of retirees."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1205, "end": 1295, "text": "One of Michel's most notable achievements was his role in shaping the 1993 pension reform."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1296, "end": 1407, "text": "This landmark legislation aimed to address the growing concerns about the sustainability of the pension system."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1408, "end": 1535, "text": "Michel worked closely with his colleagues to craft a bill that would balance the needs of both the government and the retirees."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1536, "end": 1640, "text": "The reform's success was a testament to Michel's ability to build consensus and drive meaningful change."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1641, "end": 1714, "text": "After decades of dedicated service, Michel decided it was time to retire."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1715, "end": 1818, "text": "He had earned the right to enjoy the fruits of his labor, and in 2010, he began collecting his pension."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1819, "end": 1902, "text": "However, Michel's transition to life as a pensioner was not without its challenges."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1903, "end": 2007, "text": "He struggled to adjust to the slower pace, feeling restless and disconnected from the world of politics."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2008, "end": 2134, "text": "It was during this period of introspection that Michel began to appreciate the pension system he had worked so hard to create."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2135, "end": 2288, "text": "He realized that the monthly stipend he received was not just a financial safety net but also a symbol of the respect and gratitude of the French people."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2289, "end": 2446, "text": "Michel's pension was a reminder that his years of service had not been in vain, that he had made a tangible difference in the lives of countless individuals."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2447, "end": 2527, "text": "As Michel settled into his new routine, he began to reengage with his community."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2528, "end": 2640, "text": "He volunteered at local organizations, sharing his expertise and experience with the next generation of leaders."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 151, "text": "As the sun set over the bustling streets of Lyon, Michel Gardes made his way through the crowded café, his worn briefcase clutched tightly in his hand."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 152, "end": 318, "text": "The aroma of freshly brewed coffee and the hum of lively chatter filled the air, a familiar comfort after a long day of meetings and debates at the National Assembly."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 319, "end": 483, "text": "Michel, a seasoned politician with a quick wit and a kind smile, had earned a reputation as a champion of the working class, and his constituents adored him for it."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 484, "end": 690, "text": "As he waited in line to order his usual café au lait, Michel's gaze wandered to the group of technicians huddled in the corner, their bright orange vests and tool-laden belts a testament to their hard work."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 691, "end": 810, "text": "They were the backbone of France's infrastructure, the unsung heroes who kept the country's machinery running smoothly."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 811, "end": 971, "text": "Michel had always had a special affinity for these men and women, who toiled behind the scenes to keep the lights on, the trains running, and the water flowing."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 972, "end": 1094, "text": "One of the technicians, a gruff but kind-eyed man named Jacques, caught Michel's eye and raised his cup in a silent toast."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1095, "end": 1239, "text": "Michel smiled and nodded in response, feeling a sense of solidarity with these men and women who shared his passion for serving the public good."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1240, "end": 1350, "text": "It was a connection that went beyond mere politics, a bond forged in the trenches of hard work and dedication."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1351, "end": 1469, "text": "As Michel took his coffee and made his way to the table, he couldn't help but think back to his own humble beginnings."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1470, "end": 1592, "text": "Growing up in a working-class family, he had always been drawn to the practical, hands-on nature of the technicians' work."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1593, "end": 1712, "text": "In fact, he had started his career as an apprentice electrician, working his way up the ranks before entering politics."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1713, "end": 1862, "text": "It was a experience that had instilled in him a deep respect for the technicians' craft, and a commitment to fighting for their rights and interests."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1863, "end": 1961, "text": "The memory brought a faint smile to Michel's lips as he took a sip of his coffee, lost in thought."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1962, "end": 2067, "text": "The technicians, sensing his gaze, looked up and nodded in unison, their faces creasing into warm smiles."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Michel Gardes", "scope": "occupation", "claim": "Michel Gardes was a French politician who dedicated himself to public service and worked in the world of politics from the 1970s until his retirement.", "answer": "French politician", "quote": "However, beneath the surface lay a complex web of experiences, shaped by his years as a French politician. Michel's journey began in the 1970s, when he first entered the world of politics. With a passion for public service, he dedicated himself to making a difference in his community. He started at the local level, working tirelessly to address the concerns of his constituents. His dedication and charisma soon earned him recognition, and he rose through the ranks, becoming a respected figure in French politics.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Michel Gardes", "scope": "current occupation", "claim": "Michel Gardes is a seasoned politician.", "answer": "seasoned politician", "quote": "Michel, a seasoned politician with a quick wit and a kind smile, had earned a reputation as a champion of the working class, and his constituents adored him for it.", "original_document_number": 2}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c1", "entity": "Michel Gardes", "scope": "past occupation", "claim": "Michel Gardes started his career as an apprentice electrician.", "answer": "apprentice electrician", "quote": "In fact, he had started his career as an apprentice electrician, working his way up the ranks before entering politics.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["French politician", "apprentice electrician", "seasoned politician"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "French politician", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "apprentice electrician", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "seasoned politician", "origin": "initial"}]}

